msgstr "Oteur"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:260
msgid "Audible Bell"
msgstr "Oyåve xhuflet"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:268
msgid "Use &system bell"
msgstr "Eployî li xhuflet do &sistinme"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:270
msgid "Us&e customized bell"
msgstr "Eployî xhuflet da &vosse"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:272
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, the default system bell will be used. See the "
"\"System Bell\" control module for how to customize the system bell. "
"Normally, this is just a \"beep\"."
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:275
msgid ""
"<p>Check this option if you want to use a customized bell, playing a sound "
"file. If you do this, you will probably want to turn off the system bell.</"
"p><p> Please note that on slow machines this may cause a \"lag\" between the "
"event causing the bell and the sound being played.</p>"
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:284
msgid "Sound &to play:"
msgstr "Son a &djouwer:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:288
msgid "Browse..."
msgstr "Foyter..."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:290
msgid ""
"If the option \"Use customized bell\" is enabled, you can choose a sound "
"file here. Click \"Browse...\" to choose a sound file using the file dialog."
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:307
msgid "Visible Bell"
msgstr "Veyåve xhuflet"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:315
msgid "&Use visible bell"
msgstr "&Eployî veyåve xhuflet"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:317
msgid ""
"This option will turn on the \"visible bell\", i.e. a visible notification "
"shown every time that normally just a bell would occur. This is especially "
"useful for deaf people."
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:325
msgid "I&nvert screen"
msgstr "Waitroûle e &negatif"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:330
msgid ""
"All screen colors will be inverted for the amount of time specified below."
msgstr ""
"Totes les coleurs del waitroûle seront metowes e negatif pol tins dné chal "
"pa dzo."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:332
msgid "F&lash screen"
msgstr "Påp&iaedje del waitroûle"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:334
msgid ""
"The screen will turn to a custom color for the amount of time specified "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Li waitroûla va påpyî, dj' ô bén k' ele divénrè po on tins metou tote d' ene "
"coleur dinêye."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:340
msgid ""
"Click here to choose the color used for the \"flash screen\" visible bell."
msgstr ""
"Clitchîz chal po tchoezi l' coleur pol veyåve xhuflet «påpiaedje del "
"waitroûle»."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:349
msgid "Duration:"
msgstr "Tins:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:350 kcmaccess.cpp:470 kcmaccess.cpp:512
msgid " msec"
msgstr " ms"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:352
msgid ""
"Here you can customize the duration of the \"visible bell\" effect being "
"shown."
msgstr ""
"Chal vos ploz apontyî a vosse môde li tins ki l' «veyåve xhuflet» va esse "
"håyné."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:369
msgid "&Bell"
msgstr "&Xhuflet"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:379
msgid "S&ticky Keys"
msgstr "Ac&lawåvès tapes"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:387
msgid "Use &sticky keys"
msgstr "Eployî les acla&wåvès tapes"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:394
msgid "&Lock sticky keys"
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:401
msgid "Turn sticky keys off when two keys are pressed simultaneously"
msgstr ""
"Dismete les aclawåvès tapes cwand deus tapes sont tchôkeyes e minme tins"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:408
msgid "Use system bell whenever a modifier gets latched, locked or unlocked"
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:411
msgid "Locking keys"
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:419
msgid "Use system bell whenever a locking key gets activated or deactivated"
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:422
msgid ""
"Use KDE's system notification mechanism whenever a modifier or locking key "
"changes its state"
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:446
msgid "&Modifier Keys"
msgstr "Tapes &modifieus"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:454
msgid "Slo&w Keys"
msgstr "&Londjinnès tapes"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:462
msgid "&Use slow keys"
msgstr "&Eployî des londjinnès tapes"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:472
msgid "Acceptance dela&y:"
msgstr "&Tårdjaedje po-z accepter:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:479
msgid "&Use system bell whenever a key is pressed"
msgstr "&Eployî l' xhuflet do sistinme cwand ene tape est tchôkeye"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:486
msgid "&Use system bell whenever a key is accepted"
msgstr "&Eployî l' xhuflet do sistinme cwand ene tape est acceptêye"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:493
msgid "&Use system bell whenever a key is rejected"
msgstr "&Eployî l' xhuflet do sistinme cwand ene tape est rfuzêye"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:496
msgid "Bounce Keys"
msgstr "Dimey-aclawåvès tapes"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:504
msgid "Use bou&nce keys"
msgstr "Eployî les dme&y-aclawåvès tapes"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:514
msgid "D&ebounce time:"
msgstr "Tins po &disclawer:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:521
msgid "Use the system bell whenever a key is rejected"
msgstr "Eployî l' xhuflet do sistinme cwand ene tape est rfuzêye"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:539
msgid "&Keyboard Filters"
msgstr "Passetes del &taprece"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:548 kcmaccess.cpp:620
msgid "Activation Gestures"
msgstr "Djesses d' activaedje"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:556
msgid "Use gestures for activating sticky keys and slow keys"
msgstr ""
"Eployî des djesses po mete en alaedje les aclawåves et les londjinnès tapes"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:560
msgid ""
"Here you can activate keyboard gestures that turn on the following "
"features: \n"
"Sticky keys: Press Shift key 5 consecutive times\n"
"Slow keys: Hold down Shift for 8 seconds"
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:564
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"Here you can activate keyboard gestures that turn on the following "
"features: \n"
"Mouse Keys: %1\n"
"Sticky keys: Press Shift key 5 consecutive times\n"
"Slow keys: Hold down Shift for 8 seconds"
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:569
msgid "Turn sticky keys and slow keys off after a certain time of inactivity"
msgstr ""
"Dismete les aclawåves et londjinnès tapes après on metou tins sins rén fé"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:577
msgid " min"
msgstr " min"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:579
msgid "Timeout:"
msgstr "Tårdjaedje:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:582
msgid "Notification"
msgstr "Notifiaedje"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:590
msgid ""
"Use the system bell whenever a gesture is used to turn an accessibility "
"feature on or off"
msgstr ""
"Eployî l' xhuflet do sistinme cwand on djesse est eployî po mete en alaedje "
"ou dismete ene fonccionålité"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:593
msgid ""
"Show a confirmation dialog whenever a keyboard accessibility feature is "
"turned on or off"
msgstr ""
"Håyner on purnea d' acertinaedje cwand on djesse est eployî po mete en "
"alaedje ou dismete ene fonccionålité"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:595
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, KDE will show a confirmation dialog whenever a "
"keyboard accessibility feature is turned on or off.\n"
"Be carefull to know what you are doing if you uncheck it as then the "
"keyboard accessibility settings will always be applied without confirmation."
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:597
msgid ""
"Use KDE's system notification mechanism whenever a keyboard accessibility "
"feature is turned on or off"
msgstr ""

